==Trivia==
This card's illustration features the [[Fuego Ironworks]] in the background, as depicted in {{game|Diamond and Pearl|s|Pokémon Diamond, Pearl}}, {{game|Platinum||Platinum}}, {{game|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl|s|Brilliant Diamond, and Shining Pearl}}. This card is also featured in the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion's "Magnezone of Fuego Ironworks" [[Triumphant Light (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]].

===Origin===
*'''Rolling Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Sandshrew|71}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

